=== the build step: which exams get a chip ===
  ok    an exam with another question count is left off the chips, with the reason
  ok    an exam with another time limit is left off the chips, with the reason
  ok    an exam with a blueprint is left off the chips, with the reason
  ok    a pool without marks is left off the chips, with the reason
  ok    an exam with another typed setting is left off the chips, with the reason
  ok    an exam like the current one gets a chip
  ok    a course with one exam builds, with nothing to choose
  ok    an exam without an id stops the build and says so
  ok    two exams with one id stops the build and says so

